flowchart LR
  J["<b>the journal</b><br/>every packet, with refs"]:::c_store
  R["<b>counterfactual replay</b><br/>a new model, run over the<br/>recorded past"]:::c_control
  P{"<b>parity</b><br/>does it reproduce<br/>what would have been live?"}
  E["<b>evidence file</b><br/>skill, coverage, cost<br/>per pair and frame"]:::c_intel
  G["promotion gate"]:::c_model
  J --> R --> P
  P -->|no| X["discard<br/>the model is untestable"]:::c_risk
  P -->|yes| E --> G
